      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 25.5,
      "end_seconds": 30.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "He's been having bright red blood on the paper, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.04,
      "end_seconds": 41.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Oh, and itching. As for itching, about a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.83,
      "end_seconds": 45.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.41,
      "end_seconds": 58.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Okay, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.45,
      "end_seconds": 81.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 36.6 degrees, saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 127 over 77, heart rate 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.67,
      "end_seconds": 87.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.68,
      "end_seconds": 91.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.84,
      "end_seconds": 110.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "There is a soft swelling at the edge of the back passage and a non-tender rectum with no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.39,
      "end_seconds": 117.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.27,
      "end_seconds": 128.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "how about change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.34,
      "end_seconds": 133.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "no no change in bowel habit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.84,
      "end_seconds": 139.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "so, and what about black stools, tummy pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.32,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Hmm, I haven't had black stools, tummy pain or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.37,
      "end_seconds": 151.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.47,
      "end_seconds": 157.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, nothing on the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.35,
      "end_seconds": 161.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Right, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.4,
      "end_seconds": 172.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I mean, no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.03,
      "end_seconds": 176.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.97,
      "end_seconds": 184.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.57,
      "end_seconds": 190.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.81,
      "end_seconds": 196.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.08,
      "end_seconds": 199.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.41,
      "end_seconds": 202.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.66,
      "end_seconds": 207.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.0,
      "end_seconds": 211.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.03,
      "end_seconds": 217.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "So, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 221.12,
      "end_seconds": 226.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Actually, um, it's metoprolol, twice a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.28,
      "end_seconds": 231.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 232.85,
      "end_seconds": 244.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.17,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box he is on tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night, I give it to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.72,
      "end_seconds": 259.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.5,
      "end_seconds": 272.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for two years. I have an enlarged prostate, for about a year. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.76,
      "end_seconds": 284.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat is known to us, good to have that clear. Taking everything into account, this is probably haemorrhoids. We shouldn't forget an anal fissure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.2,
      "end_seconds": 322.45,
      "duration_seconds": 27.25,
      "text": "we should do a blood count for rectal bleeding i'd like you to to take a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week that should help with haemorrhoids it's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well eat more fibre and drink water please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently let's plan a check in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.11,
      "end_seconds": 324.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.47,
      "end_seconds": 327.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.93,
      "end_seconds": 333.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "right, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.16,
      "end_seconds": 335.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
